{
    "title": "Tennessee Proctor ID",
    "description": "Proctor a Tennessee driving written test online from anywhere by using Tennessee\u2019s Proctor ID App.\r\n\r\nIntuitive and easy-to-use, PID is unlocked by a selfie match to verify identity, or by using a self-selected pin or TouchID/FaceID. \r\n\r\nIn five simple steps, you can register for your Tennessee PID:\r\n1. Download the app and set permissions\r\n2. Verify access to your phone number\r\n3. Use your device camera to scan the front and back of your driver\u2019s license or ID card\r\n4. Follow the app\u2019s registration steps to take a selfie \r\n5. Set up app security and you\u2019re good to go! \r\n\r\nThis app requires an Android 7 and newer. Android 10-based EMUI 10 devices are NOT supported.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Proctor a Tennessee driving written test online from anywhere by using Tennessee\u2019s Proctor ID App.<br><br>Intuitive and easy-to-use, PID is unlocked by a selfie match to verify identity, or by using a self-selected pin or TouchID/FaceID. <br><br>In five simple steps, you can register for your Tennessee PID:<br>1. Download the app and set permissions<br>2. Verify access to your phone number<br>3. Use your device camera to scan the front and back of your driver\u2019s license or ID card<br>4. Follow the app\u2019s registration steps to take a selfie <br>5. Set up app security and you\u2019re good to go! <br><br>This app requires an Android 7 and newer. Android 10-based EMUI 10 devices are NOT supported.",
